{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "EXO",
 "chapter": 15,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.1",
   "range": "EXO.15.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5347f0b1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.1#p1-5347f0b1",
     "text": "Praising God for the overthrow of his enemies, and their deliverance.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "sang Moses and the children of"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.2",
   "range": "EXO.15.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c79181ca",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.2#p1-c79181ca",
     "text": "To worship him in it.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "prepare him an habitation"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.3",
   "range": "EXO.15.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cb3694a0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.3#p1-88c5fbb0",
     "text": "In battle he always overcomes.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "man of war"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.3#p2-6d8fa0e1",
     "text": "Always constant in his promises.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "name"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.7",
   "range": "EXO.15.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f2281040",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.7#p1-f2281040",
     "text": "Those who are enemies to God's people are his enemies.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "thee"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.11",
   "range": "EXO.15.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "05431366",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.11#p1-dd861e95",
     "text": "The scripture often so calls the mighty men of the world.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "gods"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.11#p2-14e578d4",
     "text": "Who ought to be praised with all fear and reverence.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "fearful in praises"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.13",
   "range": "EXO.15.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "79d94a05",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.13#p1-79d94a05",
     "text": "That is, into the land of Canaan, or into mount Zion.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "habitation"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.17",
   "range": "EXO.15.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8855620f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.17#p1-8855620f",
     "text": "Which was mount Zion, where later the temple was built.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "inheritance"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.20",
   "range": "EXO.15.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3d556801",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.20#p1-3d556801",
     "text": "Signifying their great joy: a custom the Jews observed in certain situations, Jud 11:34 but it should not be used as a means to justify our wanton dances.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "dances",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jud 11:34",
       "ref": "JDG.11.34"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.21",
   "range": "EXO.15.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "39614f2d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.21#p1-39614f2d",
     "text": "By singing the same song of thanksgiving.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "answered them"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.22",
   "range": "EXO.15.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d9e5f7c7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.22#p1-d9e5f7c7",
     "text": "Which was called Etham, Nu 33:8.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "Shur",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 33:8",
       "ref": "NUM.33.8"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.25",
   "range": "EXO.15.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a37eadbb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.25#p1-a37eadbb",
     "text": "That is, God, or Moses in God's name.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "he proved them"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.15.26",
   "range": "EXO.15.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "aae73256",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.15.26#p1-aae73256",
     "text": "Which is, to do only what God commanded.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "right in his sight"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
